              "type": "math",
              "latex": "\\begin{aligned}P'(x)&=3x^2-6x-9\\\\0&=3x^2-6x-9\\\\0&=x^2-2x-3\\quad\\color{#ef6068}{(\\div3)}\\\\0&=(x-3)(x+1)\\end{aligned}",
